From bcd2fb9585f1eaa31f7b51594564c21af18eec76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 16:01:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] regulator: separate read-only DA921x provider snapshot

Give the provider owner an unconditional read-only endpoint and stable two-sample callback while retaining every delayed transaction field and Buck-B writer behind the existing positive option. Keep acquire and release as zero-I/O refusals when that option is off.
